                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Update . Changes by devoplers have been positive. Day time is now light enough to see. Long puzzle is now saved when you are killed. You can only rebind some keys cursor left and right for instance can not be change. \n\nStory is interesting just a shame I keep getting killed.\n\n\nGetting very peeved collected all items to summon a ghost and then got killed so start all over again.\nThis game needs a better save system currently destroys the game.\n\n8.5 hours in and still not bound my first ghost . Collected over 20 objects and still keep getting killed and start all over again. Last time chased down by three ghosts. \n\nTime to uninstall,",
